cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use curvo, please cite it as below."
title: "curvo: a curvature-orchestration and mechanistic-inference pipeline for membrane biology"
abstract: >-
  curvo searches over physical representations of membrane-curvature players
  (amphipathic-helix wedge, disordered-region crowding, clathrin coat, tension,
  cortical active stress) against a cheap analytic evaluator, using physics rules
  as guardrails rather than fixed decisions. It runs both forward
  (players + parameters -> shape) and inverse (observed shape(t) -> forces +
  favored mechanism + calibrated uncertainty + a disambiguating experiment).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Joseph
    given-names: Jophin
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
